            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mama Swanson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved it. Next time I would try decreasing sugar to 1 TBSP. I also didn’t read recipe carefully, so put everything together, tossed, refrigerated and served 20 minutes later. FANTASTIC—onions were well marinated, everything melded and tasty. This one is a keeper.",
