              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Anna Bates"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So tasty and fresh! I used dried dill and it came out fine. I also diced up the garlic and left it in because we're big garlic fans in this household, taking it out is just silly ;) Overall a quick and easy recipe, I'll definitely be adding this into our rotation!!",
