              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "formymen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Just finished making this. I did not have fresh dill so I used dill weed. I used Splenda in place of sugar, and not as much as I should have. A teaspoon of dill weed, less onions, and not as much of the vinegar. I tasted and tested as I slowly drizzled in the Italian flavored red wine vinegar. Absolutely delicious. Thank you for submitting.",
