            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tracy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was so surprised at how quickly this came together; I forgot to save out the avocado till the second \"chilling\", so it all went in together, but didn't hurt the taste at all. Not sure that the quartered garlic added any flavor, but it didn't hurt, of course. I had no fresh dill, so used about 1/2 tsp of the dried dill weed. This salad is SO good; a keeper!",
